(Leonard:)Oh, true, but think of how
much you've accomplished.

3
00:00:07,196 --> 00:00:09,766
(Leonard:)Who got him to stop
Purelling his pocket change?

4
00:00:09,765 --> 00:00:11,765
(Scene:)Me.

5
00:00:11,767 --> 00:00:13,867
(Leonard:)And who got him to put
things other than gloves

6
00:00:13,869 --> 00:00:15,599
(Leonard:)in the glove compartment?

7
00:00:15,605 --> 00:00:17,535
(Scene:)Me.

8
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:19,210
(Amy:)It was mittens.

9
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:20,508
(Penny:)Mm.

10
00:00:20,509 --> 00:00:22,639
(Leonard:)And who got him to
try a turkey dog?

11
00:00:22,645 --> 00:00:23,845
(Amy:)That was actually Koothrappali,

12
00:00:23,846 --> 00:00:26,476
