becomes a real boy.

16
00:00:33,823 --> 00:00:35,323
(Amy:)You know, you're right.

17
00:00:35,324 --> 00:00:36,924
(Amy:)I'm in this relationship, too.

18
00:00:36,926 --> 00:00:37,926
(Amy:)I need to stand up for myself.

19
00:00:37,926 --> 00:00:38,936
