20
00:00:38,933 --> 00:00:41,763
(Amy:)And if he doesn't like it,
he can move back here.

21
00:00:41,764 --> 00:00:45,764
(Leonard:)Oh. He can try. He'd just
need a good locksmith.

22
00:00:48,537 --> 00:00:51,337
